            text: _("Yes, I believe that is our quarry."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Crelanu! Still he haunts us. Remind me again why we didn’t kill him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gwendir",
            text: _("Ardonna of Tarrynth and Rassin Tabin, you stand convicted of necromancy, and are sentenced to death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ras-Tabahn",
            text: _("Is that all? Death holds no terror for us as we have died already. You will follow shortly."),
